 <tr><th>Using OAuth</th><th>Using a GitHub PAT</th></tr>
 <tr><th align=left colspan=2>VS Code (version 1.101 or greater)</th></tr>
 <tr valign=top>
 <td>
   
 ```json
 {
   "servers": {
     "github": {
       "type": "http",
       "url": "https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/"
     }
   }
 }
 ```
 
 </td>
 <td>
 
 ```json
 {
   "servers": {
     "github": {
       "type": "http",
       "url": "https://api.githubcopilot.com/mcp/",
       "headers": {
         "Authorization": "Bearer ${input:github_mcp_pat}"
       }
